{"id":"cruaute_","lemma":"cruauté","pos":"noun","rank":4962,"glosses":["cruelty","a cruel act"],"ipa":"/kʁy.o.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/34/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-cruaut%C3%A9.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-cruaut%C3%A9.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cruautés"},"formAudio":{"cruautés":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/16/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-cruaut%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La cruauté humaine est sans limites.","en":"Human cruelty has no limits.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"human","l":"humain"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"edgy","l":"limite"}]},{"text":"Ils le réprouvèrent pour sa cruauté envers les animaux.","en":"They condemned him for his cruelty to animals.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"his"},null,{"g":"reverse"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"animal","l":"animal"}]},{"text":"Elle a parlé avec force contre la cruauté envers les animaux.","en":"She spoke out strongly against cruelty to animals.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to speak, talk","l":"parler"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"force"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"reverse"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"animal","l":"animal"}]},{"text":"La cruauté humaine est dénuée de limites.","en":"Human cruelty has no limits.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"human","l":"humain"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"lacking , devoid","l":"dénué"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"edgy","l":"limite"}]},{"text":"C'est un acte de cruauté que d'enfermer un petit enfant dans sa chambre.","en":"It is an act of cruelty to lock a small child in his room.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"act"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to lock up"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"small, little"},{"g":"child"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"a room."}]}]}